    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47449" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tamphĭlus</span></b> , i,
		m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a Roman surname.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> Cn. Baebius Tamphilus,
				<i><span class="en">Liv.
				31, 49 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">Nep.
				Hann. 13, 1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Baebius Tamphilus, <i><span class="en">Liv. 21,
			6</span></i>.— Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tamphĭlĭānus</span></b> , a,
				um, adj., <i>belonging to
				Tamphilus</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">domus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Nep.
					Att. 13, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
